71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lbZ0rwUjr_0Q7kNvwGbrjE_&_nc_oc=AdpVi0aELGHgqEOThPR76KWsC2i99K_xm2njdXtZLgyb9BK4a21fTdbaPQRe5NdOlIs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGXYA0BQB-DZ8sb7h-3JGovvmGHZ5PeusSL11f7xuALug&oe=6A71E4B9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZH4XX63iT9cQ7kNvwG2hb-J&_nc_oc=Adq6s6YWKS2uOxuRVnQDodCaPAjJak-flgoKEVUawcJdkyN2sx5zDT6ZtCQ_RiwekBA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGZYeCHdb4csxO18zJisXbpzGAilaWQeKOigx5aFXNJsw&oe=6A71F793"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NyUZ_sfJjh8Q7kNvwHQf0Wh&_nc_oc=AdokMzjD1PSnqUmJBD9MEclIh5zWEDI5EmFd6vrQYM8M8V-Qw0YmXdYQxevI5qAb4Qk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGD4Q4bizOto3tw8UY4K6SUyveRT7oBVSHY5ThHeMY2SA&oe=6A71F5DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: